Third-party assets:

- public/fonts/NotoSansSC-Subset.otf is a subset of Noto Sans CJK SC,
  (c) Google LLC, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (https://openfontlicense.org/). The subset was produced with fonttools and
  covers ASCII, Latin-1, Greek, Cyrillic, general/CJK punctuation, circled
  numbers, kana, fullwidth forms and the CJK Unified Ideographs block.
